  "notes": "Modified cash basis village; treated as cash. Governmental beginning/ending cash = total governmental funds fund balances (p5; cash and CDs, less payroll taxes withheld). Balance sheet = government-wide Statement of Net Position Total column (p1), which includes both governmental and business-type. Business-type measure net position; receipts = sales + interest income, disbursements = operating expenses + debt principal and interest (all from p7), 401,584+219,621-165,440=455,765. Budget schedule p9 (all funds) not recorded in detail to avoid double counting with the departmental schedules p10-11; it covers only combined all-fund revenues for Debt Service/CDBG funds (no separate detail). Proprietary statement of cash flows exists (p8) but proprietary field left null (non-GAAP). Contributions and grants 47,691 split by fund column (p5): CDBG Fund 35,746 federal grants, General Fund 11,945 donations/contributions. Read pages 1-11 of 11."
